@startuml
actor Educator
participant "CMS (Studio)" as CMS
participant "MySQL" as DB
participant "MongoDB" as MDB

Educator -> CMS: Click "New Course"
CMS -> CMS: Validate course ID
CMS -> DB: INSERT course_overview
DB --> CMS: OK
CMS -> MDB: Initialize course structure
MDB --> CMS: OK
CMS --> Educator: Course created
@enduml